WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:01.825
Here are numbers.

2
00:00:02.075 --> 00:00:11.325
You want to make good a track of zero nine zero true at a boat speed of ten knots, and the current sets one eight zero at two knots, pushing you south.

3
00:00:11.575 --> 00:00:15.025
From the start, draw two miles toward one eight zero.

4
00:00:15.275 --> 00:00:19.325
From that point, swing ten miles until you hit the track line.

5
00:00:19.575 --> 00:00:27.825
The line you just swung runs about zero seven eight true, so you steer zero seven eight, crabbing about twelve degrees into the current.

6
00:00:28.075 --> 00:00:33.175
Your speed along the track, the speed made good, is about nine point eight knots.
